  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0\n - First Visualizer - Charts.Pie\nv1.0.1\n - Upgraded SetValues from using float to double for Current and Max, and Multiplier Values; Old internal Pie Region Disposal can now be toggled by setting true to \"EnableInternalDisposal\"\n - Calculates Inner Radius on the constructor instead of the SetValues Method\n - Added \"EnableInternalDisposal\" to dispose Region created previously by the Pie.SetValues method\n - Naming corrections. Now called \"Diameter\" instead of \"Radius\" to correctly reflect with the behavior\n - Implemented some internal value clamps, and re-evaluated calculations to match some parts of the Pie Code.",
